  "description": "The meme is designed for car enthusiasts, particularly those who own or are familiar with Dodge trucks, as it humorously exaggerates the stereotype of Dodge Ram owners being overly proud of their vehicles to the point of refusing to be photographed. The visual of the proud truck owner and the text 'dodge owners be like' directly target this community by referencing a common trope within car enthusiast culture.",
